      "text": "# 🎓 EduCRM System Graph & Live Architecture\n\n- **Live App**: [https://education-crm-9fee2.web.app](https://education-crm-9fee2.web.app)\n- **Git Remote**: `MujtabaZaheer/CRM.git` (`main`)\n\n### 🎨 Status Legend\n- 🟢 **Green**: Implemented & Live (100% Core Modules)\n- 🟡 **Yellow**: Phase 2/3 Roadmap Stubs",
